@ ---- LBL :HAS: X = a region: X = 1 when its data program was found (R79), else 0 ----
LBL 03                          ; :HAS:
1
-
2
X<>Y
Y^X
RCL 79
X<>Y
÷
IP
2
MOD
RTN
