@ ---- LBL :ROW: X = a packed row into the indexed matrix (STOEL J+): R48 values of two digits each (value x R46 +
@ 50), the leftmost first ----
LBL 04                          ; :ROW:
STO 47
RCL 48
STO 49
DO 03
  RCL 47
  100
  RCL 49
  1
  -
  Y^X
  ÷
  IP
  100
  MOD
  50
  -
  RCL÷ 46
  STOEL
  J+
  DSE 49
WHILE 03
ENDDO 03
RTN
