@ ---- LBL :CLOCK: R85 today (JDN of the calculator's date), R86 the hour now ----
LBL 05                          ; :CLOCK:
Date→ⅅ
Time→ℸ
ⅅℸ→J
0.5
+
STO 86
IP
STO 85
RCL 86
FP
24
×
STO 86
RTN
@ ======== the port ========
@ ---- LBL :LOAD: the port R21 of the region R20: its data program; G = the phases (deg), LH = the logs of the
@ amplitudes (m; a missing constituent: H = 0, LN(1E-40) = -92, so e^ makes it 0) ----
LBL 06                          ; :LOAD:
0
STO 92
XEQ 07                          ; -> :REG:
RCL 21
XEQ 07                          ; -> :REG:
RCL "HG"
0.00001
×
IP
STO "HH"
RCL "HG"
RCL "HH"
100000
